"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"we received your declaration of revocation.\n"
"\n"
"- Date and time: {created}\n"
"- Name: {name}\n"
"- Order: {code}\n"
"\n"
"Your right of withdrawal is currently being reviewed. Please note that this "
"email\n"
